{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A grade 8 class surveyed its students to see how they get to school each day. The data collected is in the chart shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The percentage of the students that get to school by car is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/287145ce1748182901ee8d6657d216125b58737d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4\\% \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6\\% \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\%\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 30\\%\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"454\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the table, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students walk to school, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> students use a bike to get to school, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> students ride the bus to get to school, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> people get to school by car. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff326b084163534036853fa3ec145f03790f43e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + 5 + 9 + 6 = 15 + 15 = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"239\" height=\"15\" /> students were surveyed, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/c/19cf6ac802acb7c2f075706e1e6f435c0d472872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6}{30} = \\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" /> of the students get to school by car, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/7/58780e460a0f462d9b4195a241945e0628467137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 20\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"81\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" c